      "updated": 1741656703494,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Topic -> metric. p99, error\nPartition -> to scale. -> lots of partition. -> 100\nKey -> ordered data \n-> single partition\n\n.. later\n\nTopic -> ServiceErrorRateMetric. \n           P99Metric. \n\nKey -> order wise -> timestamp. \nkey -> Service( loginservice ) + Api ( signup ) \n\norder -> for particular api of a particular service. \nmultiple apis -> different partition. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Topic -> metric. p99, error\nPartition -> to scale. -> lots of partition. -> 100\nKey -> ordered data \n-> single partition\n\n.. later\n\nTopic -> ServiceErrorRateMetric. \n           P99Metric. \n\nKey -> order wise -> timestamp. \nkey -> Service( loginservice ) + Api ( signup ) \n\norder -> for particular api of a particular service. \nmultiple apis -> different partition. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
